  "details": "Would be cool to have a Behavior function that allows you to disable different buttons/toggles/etc based on the options you set.\nOne example being something like disabled all buttons/toggles using parameter x.\nor \nGiven all toggles a unique ID and allow you to specify one specific toggle based on that and not the parameter.\nA note would be.\nThis wouldn't change the value, only make it impossible to click it in the expression menu, basically turn them \"Grey\" like when they're currently playing. Or to make it more easily understandable.\nMake it another color, perhaps of your choice when its disabled.",
